      "mentions": [
        "char_old_immortal_hua_yu",
        "house_dragon_palace",
        "char_wu_shuai",
        "loc_profound_literature_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The moment Dragon Palace is struck, layers of frost solidify on its surface and greatly slow its speed. The frost continues to condense and spread, and in a blink of an eye is already as tall as an adult’s calf. If this went on, the whole of Dragon Palace would be sealed in ice. Wu Shuai snorts and activates his defensive killer move. The frost on Dragon Palace’s surface begins to melt gradually.",
      "chapters": [
        2009
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Old Immortal Hua Yu is alone as he watches the approaching stars, his expression grim. He uses cold words together with shattered words. The first move creates frost that slows the stars.",
